  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 8.7.x\n### All packages\n* Added .NET 10 TFM\n* Updated to C# Language Version 14\n* Converted extension methods to C# 14 extension members\n* Removed deprecated code\n* Enabled Trim Analyzer for package\n* Marked package with ``<IsTrimmable>`` set to true.\n\n### Main package\n* Updated from Polyfill 8.9.1 to 9.0.1\n* Add SecureString AppendString, AppendChars, SetString and SetChars extension methods @alastairlundy (https://github.com/alastairlundy/DotExtensions/pull/118)\n* Move Process related extensions to CliInvoke @alastairlundy (https://github.com/alastairlundy/DotExtensions/pull/116)\n* Renamed DateTime, TimeOnly, and DateOnly ``Abs`` extension methods to ``Difference``\n* Renamed DirectoryInfo ``IsDirectoryEmpty`` extension to ``IsEmpty`` and converted it to a C# 14 extension property\n* Renamed DriveInfo ``IsDriveEmpty`` extension to ``IsEmpty`` and converted it to a C# 14 extension property\n* Converted UnixFileMode ``HasExecutePermission`` extension method to C# 14 extension property\n* Renamed Version ``ToHumanReadableString`` C# extension member method to ``ToReadableString``\n* Renamed Version comparison extension methods to remove redundant ``Version`` suffix\n* Added Version ``GetNewerVersion`` C# 14 static extension member method to get the newer version out of 2 specified versions\n* Added Version ``GetOlderVersion`` C# 14 static extension member method to get the older version out of 2 specified versions",
